  "classification": "Decisions are labelled individually; unique control episode IDs deduplicate repeated decisions. Genuine opportunity means v159Decide did not consume the action, v157ContinueTurn did not consume it, and no pending turn existed at entry. Decisions reached after an invalid pending turn are separately visible in opportunity gate totals, excluded from genuine opportunities.",
